<h2 id="more-shipped-same-guardrails">
  <a href="#more-shipped-same-guardrails">More shipped, same guardrails</a>
</h2>
<p>
  At Filestage, we've gone from around <strong>200 to 300 merged PRs a month</strong>
  without an increase in bug reports. That's roughly 50% more, with a $20 monthly
  AI subscription per developer. Everyone chooses their own tool: some use Codex,
  some Claude Code, some Cursor. PR counts only tell part of the story. We're also
  tackling bigger changes across the product in less time and with more confidence.
</p>
